00:15:59.520 --> 00:16:00.420
Hamburger.

00:16:00.420 --> 00:16:01.230
Ah!

00:16:01.230 --> 00:16:02.190
Chomp!

00:16:04.410 --> 00:16:06.110
Ouch!

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:07.920
You hit the same spot as earlier!

00:16:07.920 --> 00:16:08.960
Sorry-nano.

00:16:08.960 --> 00:16:10.310
Are you okay-bruegel?

00:16:10.310 --> 00:16:11.890
Stay here, Dorothy.

00:16:11.890 --> 00:16:12.870
Nano!

00:16:13.570 --> 00:16:15.220
Dorothy, are you okay?!

00:16:15.220 --> 00:16:16.280
Let's treat her.

00:16:19.630 --> 00:16:20.540
Huh?

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:21.600
Huh? Wha?

00:16:21.600 --> 00:16:23.180
Which way did he go-turner.

00:16:23.180 --> 00:16:24.310
Let's split up and search for him!

00:16:24.310 --> 00:16:25.370
Okay-nano!

00:16:25.370 --> 00:16:26.750
Roger-daVinci!

00:16:30.170 --> 00:16:32.500
Where are you, phantom thief?!

00:16:33.210 --> 00:16:33.630
Ah!

00:16:34.240 --> 00:16:35.590
Stop!

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:41.060
Huh?

00:16:44.240 --> 00:16:45.390
Flowers?

00:16:46.440 --> 00:16:48.440
They're Casablancas.

00:16:49.490 --> 00:16:51.400
Phantom Thief Genius!

00:16:51.400 --> 00:16:54.040
In the language of flowers, Casablanca means...

00:16:54.040 --> 00:16:57.420
...dignified royalty and...

00:16:57.420 --> 00:16:59.010
...a grand love.

00:16:59.870 --> 00:17:02.120
They're flowers fitting of myself.

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:03.220
Uh-huh...

00:17:03.220 --> 00:17:05.980
Welcome to my secret hideaway,

00:17:05.980 --> 00:17:07.440
the Red Room.

00:17:07.440 --> 00:17:09.340
Oh, pardon the intrusion!

00:17:09.340 --> 00:17:12.120
PriPara has some really nice rooms, huh?

00:17:12.120 --> 00:17:14.370
I'd like to have a little chat with you.

00:17:14.370 --> 00:17:15.950
Huh? A chat?

00:17:15.950 --> 00:17:17.160
About what?

00:17:17.160 --> 00:17:18.100
Wait!

00:17:18.100 --> 00:17:20.810
You're not getting away again, Phantom Thief Genius!

00:17:22.060 --> 00:17:24.090
The light that shines in my heart is the star of justice!

00:17:24.090 --> 00:17:26.470
With wisdom and courage I shall drive away the darkness!

00:17:26.470 --> 00:17:27.200
Poan!

00:17:27.200 --> 00:17:30.520
I am the PriPara Police apprentice, Manaka Lala-daVinci!

00:17:35.200 --> 00:17:37.310
Cut the sentence ender.

00:17:37.310 --> 00:17:38.940
Why did you use that?!

00:17:38.940 --> 00:17:41.200
I got it from Chief Ajimi.

00:17:41.200 --> 00:17:43.110
She told me to introduce myself like this.

00:17:43.110 --> 00:17:45.160
It's a most horrible introduction.

00:17:45.570 --> 00:17:48.130
You're under arrest, Phantom Thief Genius!

00:17:48.130 --> 00:17:50.440
You're not afraid of me?

00:17:50.440 --> 00:17:52.340
You're a little scary,

00:17:52.340 --> 00:17:54.230
but I want to protect the things I love!

00:17:54.230 --> 00:17:56.510
You love them enough to look past your fear?

00:17:56.510 --> 00:17:57.880
I love them!

00:17:57.880 --> 00:17:59.340
I see.

00:18:07.710 --> 00:18:08.980
Manaka Lala,

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:12.270
you might actually have the qualifications.

00:18:19.760 --> 00:18:20.660
Everyone!

00:18:20.660 --> 00:18:22.580
Lala, are you okay?

00:18:22.580 --> 00:18:24.040
How'd you find me?

00:18:24.400 --> 00:18:27.000
The sunflower seeds you dropped.

00:18:28.700 --> 00:18:30.790
These four used them to find you.

00:18:32.200 --> 00:18:34.030
Sunflower seeds?

00:18:36.090 --> 00:18:38.050
Oh, back then!

00:18:38.050 --> 00:18:40.890
You arrogant Phantom Thief Genius!

00:18:40.890 --> 00:18:42.090
It doesn't take any calculations!

00:18:42.090 --> 00:18:45.520
It's obvious that one would desire to protect the things they love-pri!

00:18:45.520 --> 00:18:47.280
Give me back my coord!

00:18:47.280 --> 00:18:49.460
Hell patiently awaits thee-dearu.

00:18:49.460 --> 00:18:52.020
There's no end to these!

00:18:52.400 --> 00:18:56.000
I just can't stop myself-marcelDuchamp.

00:18:56.000 --> 00:18:57.200
Stay in order-panda!

00:18:57.200 --> 00:18:58.990
Switch out already-panda!

00:18:58.990 --> 00:19:00.950
Come on! Stop eating!

00:19:00.950 --> 00:19:04.590
I expect this with Mikan and the goats,
but the pandas are supposed to be guards!

00:19:04.590 --> 00:19:06.760
Neglecting your duties calls for the questioning of your responsibility!

00:19:06.760 --> 00:19:08.940
Yeah! Mikan won't forgive you-nano!

00:19:08.940 --> 00:19:11.920
Don't act so happy!
You've been placed on the same level as the goats!

00:19:11.920 --> 00:19:14.630
In the first place, Ajimi-sensei, you're at an age when you should know better,

00:19:14.630 --> 00:19:17.030
so please show a little more restraint-pri.

00:19:17.730 --> 00:19:20.240
No talking about one's age-daVinci!

00:19:21.400 --> 00:19:24.890
I won't get in the way of...

00:19:27.470 --> 00:19:29.140
...your sunflower seed eating party.

00:19:29.140 --> 00:19:30.440
Ah!

00:19:34.650 --> 00:19:37.610
Hey! Wait!

00:19:42.380 --> 00:19:46.850
The PriPara Police tailed Phantom Thief Genius all the way to the PriRail subway,

00:19:46.850 --> 00:19:48.420
but that's where they lost him.

00:19:48.420 --> 00:19:49.570
He's not here.

00:19:49.570 --> 00:19:51.620
Did he escape on the PriRail?

00:19:51.620 --> 00:19:55.160
You mean the PriPara Police had him cornered?

00:19:55.160 --> 00:19:56.340
Not bad.

00:19:56.680 --> 00:20:00.020
What if they actually caught him?!

00:20:00.020 --> 00:20:01.820
Think there's a hunk under that mask?

00:20:01.820 --> 00:20:03.050
Of course!

00:20:08.010 --> 00:20:09.520
The PriPara Police and...

00:20:09.520 --> 00:20:11.230
...the PriPara Nurses...

00:20:11.230 --> 00:20:13.750
...will catch Phantom Thief Genius!

00:20:13.750 --> 00:20:17.050
We'll get back the stolen coords and hearts.

00:20:17.050 --> 00:20:18.990
By combining our powers,

00:20:18.990 --> 00:20:21.250
we'll do the best to fill our rumbly stomachs-nano!

00:20:21.250 --> 00:20:22.620
Tension Max!

00:20:22.620 --> 00:20:23.700
Relax!

00:20:23.700 --> 00:20:25.160
Ready, set...

00:20:25.160 --> 00:20:26.870
Capisce!

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:31.540
Manaka Lala...

00:20:31.540 --> 00:20:35.330
There's nothing in her concerts that make her stand out as a prodigy...

00:20:36.510 --> 00:20:37.790
Oh well.

00:20:38.720 --> 00:20:42.010
It won't be long until I snatch away her heart.

00:22:15.650 --> 00:22:18.480
Falulu is coming back!

00:22:18.480 --> 00:22:20.690
Nice to meet you, Princess.

00:22:20.690 --> 00:22:22.230
Who are you?

00:22:22.230 --> 00:22:23.530
I am a magician.

00:22:23.850 --> 00:22:25.860
I've been waiting to meet you.

00:22:25.860 --> 00:22:27.180
To meet Falulu?

00:22:27.180 --> 00:22:28.190
Next time:

00:22:28.190 --> 00:22:29.610
Princess Falulu.
